1  | ∃x (P(x) ∧ ∀y (P(y) → (y=x)))
   |----
2  | | [a] P(a) ∧ ∀y (P(y) → (y=a))
   | |----
3  | | ∀y (P(y) → (y=a))                     ∧ Elim: 2
4  | | | [b]
   | | |----
5  | | | | [c]
   | | | |----
6  | | | | | P(b) ∧ P(c)
   | | | | |----
7  | | | | | P(b)                            ∧ Elim: 6
8  | | | | | P(c)                            ∧ Elim: 6
9  | | | | | P(b) → (b=a)                    ∀ Elim: 3
10 | | | | | P(c) → (c=a)                    ∀ Elim: 3
11 | | | | | b=a                             → Elim: 9,7
12 | | | | | c=a                             → Elim: 10,8
13 | | | | | c=c                             = Intro
14 | | | | | a=c                             = Elim: 13, 12
15 | | | | | b=c                             = Elim: 11, 14
16 | | | | (P(b) ∧ P(c)) → (b=c)             → Intro: 6-15
17 | | | ∀y ((P(b) ∧ P(y)) → (b=y))          ∀ Intro: 5-16
18 | | ∀x ∀y ((P(x) ∧ P(y)) → (x=y))         ∀ Intro: 4-17
19 | ∀x ∀y ((P(x) ∧ P(y)) → (x=y))           ∃ Elim: 1, 2-18
